{
  "_readme": [
    "The ONE registry of image models: ids, engine, caps, resolutions, aspects, pricing,",
    "deprecation, ETA seeds. Server, frontend (via /api/config) and tests read it;",
    "no model id or price may be written anywhere else (tests/test_model_registry.py).",
    "engine: gemini (google-genai, app/core/generator.py) | openai (studio/openai_images.py)",
    "        | openrouter (studio/openrouter.py).",
    "surfaces: where the model is offered — studio (product wizard), lab (product wizard",
    "        on OpenAI), editorial (freeform). A deprecated model stays accepted by the API",
    "        for old presets but is listed with deprecated=true and never as a default.",
    "Sources: docs/research/nano-banana-state.md and docs/research/gpt-image-state.md",
    "        (2026-10-20). Prices USD per image unless stated.",
    "product: true on an OpenRouter model = it may run the Lab product wizard (base photo + full reference plan) — surfaces then include \"lab\". FLUX / Seedream stay editorial-only: the bake-off showed they do not preserve product geometry.",
    "surface \"meli\": the /meli wood-recolor lab lists every OpenRouter model; its default is defaults.meli."
  ],
